      "details": "<p><em>D\u012bnever</em>:\u00a0It is a town at the foot of the mountains to the west of <em>Hamad\u0101n</em> (Hamadan). According to the author of <em>Men\u0101hic\u00fc\u2019l-fikr</em>, <em>D\u012bnever</em> is called\u00a0<em>M\u0101h\u0131k\u016bfe</em>, just as\u00a0<em>Nih\u0101vend</em>\u00a0is called\u00a0<em>M\u0101h\u0131ba\u1e63ra</em>. [translation]</p>",
